  m_text: 'HOTKEYS


    Display camera directed over the AUV : 1

    Display fly
    camera : 2

    Move forward: W*

    Move backward: S*

    Move right: D*

    Move
    left: A*

    Move up: E*

    Move down: Q*

    Rotate: Hold down right-click
    mouse button


    Toggle front camera publishing on ROS : F6

    Toggle bottom
    camera publishing on ROS : F7


    Toggle covers on bins : B

    Toggle run
    setup (semi-final/final): F


    *Only available in FlyCam mode.

